A structure defines a collection of fields grouped together to form a single, coherent record. Structures define a custom GX type.


```code:main
package main

var InputSize intlen

type LinearRegression struct {
    StepSize float32
    Weights [InputSize]float32
    Bias float32
}

func Main() LinearRegression {
    return LinearRegression{
        StepSize: .5,
        Weights: [InputSize]float32{},
        Bias: 1.0,
    }
}
```


```code:config
{
    "InputSize": 3
}
```

